}
```

In this example, `PromotionBenefit` is the entity class that has a composite primary key represented by the `PromotionBenefitPK` class.

You can also use the `@EmbeddedId` annotation to embed an instance of a separate class that represents the composite primary key.

```java
@Entity
public class PromotionBenefit {
