CriteriaBuilder cb = em.getCriteriaBuilder();
CriteriaQuery<PromotionBenefit> cq = cb.createQuery(PromotionBenefit.class);
Root<PromotionBenefit> root = cq.from(PromotionBenefit.class);

cq.where(cb.in(root.get("id").get("promotionBenefitCode")).value("code1", "code2"));
```

This will create an IN predicate with multiple values on the `promotionBenefitCode` column of the primary key.

